<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for export of 100-pound (45.36 kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective from April 10 to April 16, 1997:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 60.36</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 64.28</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 66.09</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 69.41</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$166.77</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$125.08</p>
<p>Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 89.65</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 22.97</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.30</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 25.38</p>
</text>
